            "level": {
              "value": 4
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You siphon the residual energy from the last spell you cast into one weapon you're wielding. Until the end of your turn, the weapon deals an extra 1d6 damage of a type depending on the school of the spell you just cast.\n\n- **Abjuration** force damage\n- **Conjuration or Transmutation** same type as the weapon\n- **Divination, Enchantment, or Illusion** mental damage\n- **Evocation** a type the spell dealt, or force damage if the spell didn't deal damage\n- **Necromancy** negative damage"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
